 "problems": [
  "The \"Bedroom/HO/Bathroom\" column is formatted as three numbers (e.g. \"3/1/2\", \"4/1/4\", \"5/1/7\") whose middle and meaning are unclear (possibly HO = half-bath or den count); I mapped first number to beds and last number to baths where plausible (e.g. treating \"1/2\" endings as 1.5 baths), but for codes like 4/1/4, 3/1/3, 3/1/5, 4/1/5, 5/1/7 the bath figure does not clearly follow the half-bath convention, so these are noted with the raw code in the note column rather than asserted as exact baths.",
  "18C's Offering Price cell shows \"$\" with no dollar amount and no dash printed distinctly (row appears to have a formatting/merge issue in the source); recorded as \"-\"."
